<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ciudad Constitución — Repaso de Sociales</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zilla+Slab:wght@400;600;700&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EDE3CB;
    --paper-deep:#E2D6B6;
    --card:#F8F2E1;
    --ink:#1E2A3C;
    --ink-soft:#3F4F63;
    --teal:#2F5D50;
    --teal-deep:#20423A;
    --gold:#D3A237;
    --gold-deep:#B4831F;
    --brick:#9C4A2E;
    --brick-deep:#7C3A22;
    --good:#3C7A4E;
    --bad:#B24435;
    --radius-lg:22px;
    --radius-sm:10px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, #F3E9CE 0%, transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, #E8DCB9 0%, transparent 40%),
      var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Nunito Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.station-title{
    font-family:'Zilla Slab', serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0;
  }
  button{font-family:inherit;}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold-deep); outline-offset:2px;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:38px 20px 26px;
    text-align:center;
    border-bottom:3px solid var(--teal-deep);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%);
  }
  .hero-inner{max-width:720px; margin:0 auto;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.9rem); font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.2px;}
  .hero .subtitle{
    max-width:60ch; margin:12px auto 0; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.02rem;
  }

  .passport{
    margin:22px auto 0;
    max-width:520px;
    background:var(--card);
    border:2px solid var(--teal-deep);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:10px;
    box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(30,42,60,0.12);
  }
  .passport-label{font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-soft); font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap;}
  .stamps{display:flex; gap:7px;}
  .stamp{
    width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--brick);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--brick); background:transparent;
    transition:all .25s ease;
  }
  .stamp.done{
    background:var(--brick); color:#fff; border-color:var(--brick-deep);
    transform:scale(1.06);
  }

  main{max-width:920px; margin:0 auto; padding:34px 18px 60px;}
  .hidden{display:none !important;}

  /* ---------- Map / board ---------- */
  .board-intro{text-align:center; margin-bottom:26px;}
  .board-intro p{color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:56ch; margin:6px auto 0;}
  .board{
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:6px;
    padding:10px 0 10px 0;
  }
  .board::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:20px; bottom:20px; left:50%;
    width:0;
    border-left:4px dashed var(--teal);
    opacity:0.55;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
  }
  .station{
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
    width:min(560px, 92%);
    margin:14px 0;
    padding:14px 16px;
    background:var(--card);
    border:2px solid var(--teal-deep);
    border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(32,66,58,0.18);
    cursor:pointer;
    text-align:left;
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .station:hover, .station:focus-visible{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow:0 7px 0 rgba(32,66,58,0.2);
  }
  .station:nth-child(odd){align-self:flex-start; margin-left:2%;}
  .station:nth-child(even){align-self:flex-end; margin-right:2%;}
  .station-icon{
    flex:0 0 56px; width:56px; height:56px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:var(--paper-deep); border-radius:14px; border:2px solid var(--teal);
  }
  .station-icon svg{width:32px; height:32px;}
  .station-text{flex:1; min-width:0;}
  .station-title{font-size:1.18rem; font-weight:700;}
  .station-desc{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.92rem; margin-top:2px;}
  .station-mark{
    flex:0 0 auto; font-size:1.3rem; width:30px; text-align:center; color:var(--good);
  }

  /* ---------- Station view ---------- */
  .station-view{max-width:720px; margin:0 auto;}
  .back-btn{
    background:none; border:2px solid var(--teal-deep); color:var(--teal-deep);
    padding:8px 16px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .back-btn:hover{background:var(--teal-deep); color:#fff;}
  .panel{
    background:var(--card); border:2px solid var(--teal-deep); border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
    padding:26px 24px; box-shadow:0 5px 0 rgba(32,66,58,0.15);
  }
  .panel h2{font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .panel .kicker{color:var(--brick); font-weight:700; font-size:0.86rem; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .panel .instructions{color:var(--ink-soft); margin:8px 0 22px; font-size:0.96rem;}
  .progress-line{font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:14px;}

  /* quiz */
  .case-box{
    background:var(--paper-deep); border-left:5px solid var(--brick);
    padding:14px 16px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom:16px; font-size:0.96rem;
  }
  .question-text{font-weight:700; font-size:1.08rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .options{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .option-btn{
    text-align:left; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    border:2px solid var(--teal); background:#fff; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.96rem;
    transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--paper-deep);}
  .option-btn.correct{background:var(--good); border-color:var(--good); color:#fff;}
  .option-btn.incorrect{background:var(--bad); border-color:var(--bad); color:#fff;}
  .option-btn:disabled{cursor:default;}
  .explain{
    margin-top:14px; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    background:#fff; border:1px dashed var(--teal); font-size:0.92rem;
  }
  .next-btn, .primary-btn{
    margin-top:18px; background:var(--teal-deep); color:#fff; border:none;
    padding:11px 22px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.95rem;
  }
  .next-btn:hover, .primary-btn:hover{background:var(--teal);}
  .result-box{text-align:center; padding:20px 10px;}
  .result-score{font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--brick); font-family:'Zilla Slab',serif;}

  /* matching */
  .match-wrap{display:flex; gap:18px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .match-col{flex:1 1 240px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .match-item{
    padding:12px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); border:2px solid var(--teal);
    background:#fff; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.92rem; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .match-item.selected{border-color:var(--gold-deep); background:#FBEFCB;}
  .match-item.matched{background:var(--good); color:#fff; border-color:var(--good); cursor:default;}
  .match-item.wrong{animation:shake .3s;}
  @keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0);}25%{transform:translateX(-5px);}75%{transform:translateX(5px);}}

  /* ordering */
  .order-pool{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .order-chip{
    padding:10px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:2px solid var(--teal);
    background:#fff; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.9rem;
  }
  .order-chip:disabled{opacity:0.35; cursor:default;}
  .order-slots{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .order-slot{
    min-height:44px; border:2px dashed var(--brick); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    display:flex; align-items:center; padding:8px 14px; font-size:0.92rem; background:#fff;
  }
  .order-slot.filled{border-style:solid; border-color:var(--teal); background:var(--paper-deep);}
  .order-feedback{margin-top:10px; font-weight:700;}

  /* sorting */
  .sort-bins{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .sort-bin{
    flex:1 1 150px; border:2px solid var(--teal); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    padding:10px; min-height:100px; background:var(--paper-deep);
  }
  .sort-bin h4{margin:0 0 8px; font-size:0.88rem; color:var(--teal-deep); font-family:'Zilla Slab',serif;}
  .sort-bin .placed{
    font-size:0.8rem; background:var(--good); color:#fff; padding:5px 8px;
    border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .sort-pool{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;}
  .sort-chip{
    padding:9px 12px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); border:2px solid var(--brick);
    background:#fff; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.88rem;
  }
  .sort-chip.selected{background:#FBEFCB; border-color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .sort-chip.wrong{animation:shake .3s;}

  /* flashcards */
  .flash-wrap{text-align:center;}
  .flash-card{
    margin:0 auto 16px; max-width:420px; min-height:150px;
    background:var(--paper-deep); border:2px solid var(--teal); border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:22px;
    font-size:1.02rem; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(32,66,58,0.15);
  }
  .flash-card .back-label{color:var(--brick); font-weight:700; font-family:'Zilla Slab',serif; font-size:1.3rem;}
  .flash-nav{display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; align-items:center;}
  .flash-nav button{
    background:#fff; border:2px solid var(--teal-deep); border-radius:999px; padding:8px 16px;
    cursor:pointer; font-weight:700;
  }
  .flash-count{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.88rem;}

  footer{text-align:center; padding:26px 16px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.82rem;}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .station:nth-child(odd), .station:nth-child(even){align-self:center; margin:14px auto;}
    .board::before{display:none;}
    .match-wrap{flex-direction:column;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Ciudad Constitución</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Recorre la ciudad, entra a cada edificio y prepárate para la evaluación de Ciencias Sociales sobre gobierno, democracia, cargos públicos, control y participación ciudadana.</p>
    <div class="passport">
      <span class="passport-label">Tu pasaporte cívico</span>
      <div class="stamps" id="stamps"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section id="mapView">
    <div class="board-intro">
      <h2>Mapa de la ciudad</h2>
      <p>Elige un lugar para entrar. Puedes visitarlos en el orden que quieras y repetirlos las veces que necesites.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="board" id="board"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="stationView" class="station-view hidden">
    <button class="back-btn" id="backBtn">← Volver al mapa</button>
    <div class="panel" id="stationContent"></div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>Hecho para repasar en casa antes de la evaluación · Ciencias Sociales, cuarto grado</footer>

<script>
